      "Land can be flat, gently rolling or steep.",
      "Steeper land makes road and building construction more difficult and often more expensive.",
      "Harder access can reduce the amount and size of development that is practical.",
      "That helps explain why settlement patterns often differ between flatter plains and steep mountain areas."
